WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:07.000
I came here

2
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:09.300
after finding it online.

3
00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:13.400
I had pain in my back, in my spine,

4
00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:17.600
and in general I didn't feel very good.

5
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:26.000
I had treatments near where I live, acupuncture and reflexology, and they didn't help me.

6
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:31.700
Today I've had a few treatments here, I think five or so,

7
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.600
and I'm much, much better.

8
00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:36.600
I'm very satisfied.
